{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"時事全方位重點提要｜11月25日\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/MAG-PROMO-261125.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】近期本港發生連串資料外洩事件，受影響行業包括航空公司、零售業及虛擬保險公司等，企業如何防範資料外洩？市民應怎樣應對？</p><p>周三的《時事全方位》，請來專家探討。</p><p>題目：防範資料外洩</p><p>熱線電話: 1833298</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T11:24:03.269942+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T10:37:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T15:37:35.127032+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T11:17:28.549462+00:00","content_hash":"6d8bc8b25c2dc5b0e8bb8040f666d5d3a0327e8efcb2a58794b93e28aad71fe2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}